I board the red bus.
The bus is very crowded.
The conductor comes to me.
I ask him.
"Brother, I want to go to Marine Drive."
"Which is the stop for Marine Drive?"
He replies, "Madam, you get down at the Gymkhana stop."
"The sea is very close from there."
"Get down from the bus and go straight."
"Go towards the sea."
"Do not turn left or right."
"Marine Drive is right there."
I smile.
I say, "Okay, thank you brother."
The bus moves forward on the streets of Mumbai.
I look out the window.
I wait for my stop.
